            "action_name": {
              "value": "Destructive Harmonics"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, evocation, occult, sonic)\n\nThe destrachan emits a harsh sonic cry that deals 9d6 sonic damage (DC 26 basic Reflex save) in either a 60-foot cone or a 30-foot burst. It can't use Destructive Harmonics again for 1d4 rounds."
